{{nihongo|'''''Godzilla Singular Point'''''|ゴジラ S.P ＜シンギュラポイント＞|Gojira Shingyura Pointo|lead=yes}} is a Japanese [[anime]] television series directed by Atsushi Takahashi and written by [[Toh EnJoe]]. Produced by the animation studios [[Bones (studio)|Bones]] and [[Orange (animation studio)|Orange]] and licensed by [[Netflix]], the series premiered on March 25, 2021, on Netflix in Japan, and on [[Tokyo MX]] and other channels on April 1 to June 24, 2021. The series is part of the [[Godzilla (franchise)|''Godzilla'' franchise]] and features monsters from its [[Godzilla (franchise)#Shōwa era (1954–1975)|Shōwa era (1954–1975)]]. In 2023, EnJoe suggested that a second season of the series may be produced.<ref name=EnjoetohTweet>{{Cite tweet|number=1683998068855963651|user=EnJoeToh|title=Thank you for watching the program. Due to the contract, all I can say is 'There may or may not be a next season'.|author-link=Toh EnJoe|retweet=Atsushi Takahashi|date=July 26, 2023|access-date=August 4, 2023|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230804195204/https://twitter.com/EnJoeToh/status/1683998068855963651|archive-date=August 4, 2023|url-status=live}}</ref>

== Plot ==
In Nigashio City, [[Chiba Prefecture]] in the year 2030, engineer Yun Arikawa of the local "do-it-all" shop Otaki Factory investigates happenings in a Western-style mansion, long thought abandoned. Mei Kamino, a graduate student studying imaginary creatures, investigates mysterious signals received from Misakioku, the former Tsuguno district's administrative building. These two strangers, investigating mysteries in two different locations, both hear the same song. As they are brought together by this common mystery, they are led into a battle against an unprecedented threat to the universe.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2020/10/netflix-anime-series-orders-high-rise-invasion-yasuke-resident-evil-infinite-darkness-1234603802/|title=Netflix Sets Five New Anime Titles, Unveils First Looks At 'Resident Evil: Infinite Darkness', 'Yasuke', More|date=October 26, 2020|first=Patrick |last=Hipes|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201027122101/https://deadline.com/2020/10/netflix-anime-series-orders-high-rise-invasion-yasuke-resident-evil-infinite-darkness-1234603802/|archive-date=October 27, 2020|url-status=live|access-date=October 27, 2020}}</ref>

