===Accolades===
''Godzilla Singular Point'' won VFX-Japan Awards' 2022 "Excellence" and "Best" awards in the Television/Distribution Program Anime CG Category.<ref>{{Cite web|date=January 31, 2022|script-title=ja:【速報】VFX-JAPANアワード2022優秀賞決定 {{!}} 一般社団法人 VFX-JAPAN|url=https://vfx-japan.jp/award2022sokuhou/|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220131035032/https://vfx-japan.jp/award2022sokuhou/|archive-date=January 31, 2022|access-date=February 24, 2022|website=一般社団法人VFX-JAPAN|language=ja}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Pineda |first=Rafael Antonio |date=March 5, 2022 |title=Belle, Rurouni Kenshin The Final Films Win VFX-Japan Awards |url=https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2022-03-05/belle-rurouni-kenshin-the-final-films-win-vfx-japan-awards/.183224 |access-date=June 17, 2022 |website=[[Anime News Network]] |language=en}}</ref> It was also nominated for the 42nd [[Nihon SF Taisho Award]].<ref>{{Cite web |last=日本SF作家クラブ |script-title=ja:第42回日本SF大賞 受賞のことば – SFWJ:日本SF大賞 |url=https://sfwj.jp/awards/Nihon-SF-Taisho-Award/42/20220605022553.html |access-date=June 17, 2022 |website=SFWJ |language=ja}}</ref> The anime series was awarded the 53rd [[Seiun Award]] in the Best Media category in 2022.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Loo |first=Egan |date=August 27, 2022 |title=Evangelion, Irina: The Vampire Cosmonaut, Godzilla S.P., Zettai Karen Children Win Seiun Awards |url=https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2022-08-27/evangelion-irina-the-vampire-cosmonaut-godzilla-s.p-zettai-karen-children-win-seiun-awards/.189063 |access-date=August 27, 2022 |website=[[Anime News Network]] |language=en}}</ref>

==Potential sequel==
When questioned by a fan on [[Twitter]] about the possibility of a sequel to ''Godzilla Singular Point'', the screenwriter [[Toh EnJoe]] told the user: "Due to the contract, all I can say is 'There may or may not be a next season'." Director Atsushi Takahashi would acknowledge this via retweeting EnJoe's response a few days later.<ref name=EnjoetohTweet/>

